// Ordinary GLOBAL homonym of a style of the designated theme. In project mode a
// flat companion is a private script: sharing therefore goes through a
// ProcedureCollection, whose GLOBAL members are addressed by their bare name.
COL_OrdinaryStyles is a ProcedureCollection
	GLOBAL
	stAmbiance is a styleInput = {
		InputZone = { BackgroundColor = RGB(250, 250, 250) }
	}
END
